<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22825" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">indĭgus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		indigeo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>needing</i>, <i>in want</i> (<b>poet.</b> and post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nostrae opis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 428</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">externae opis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					3, 48</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stipendiorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 40, 61, § 143</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rectoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. H.
					3, 22</span></i>
			 (but <i><span class="en">Lucr. 1, 61</span></i>, is
			glossem.).—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			With abl.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">auxilio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					5, 223</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(g).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pauper et indigus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. Silv. 3, 1, 102</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., <i>desirous</i> of something; with <i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">servitii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					9, 254</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
